{title: Un poquito más}
{artist: Delia Dorta}
{year: 1980}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}

{define: Bb base-fret 1 frets 3 2 1 1}
{define: Eb base-fret 1 frets 0 3 3 1}
{define: Ebmaj7 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 4}
{define: Dm7 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 1 3}
{define: G7 base-fret 1 frets 0 2 1 2}
{define: Cm base-fret 1 frets 0 3 3 3}
{define: Cmmaj7 base-fret 1 frets 3 2 2 2}
{define: Cm7 base-fret 1 frets 3 3 3 3}
{define: F7 base-fret 1 frets 2 3 1 0}
{define: Fm base-fret 1 frets 1 0 1 3}
{define: Bb7 base-fret 1 frets 1 2 1 1}
{define: E base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 2}
{define: Emaj7 base-fret 1 frets 1 3 0 2}
{define: Ebm7 base-fret 1 frets 3 3 2 4}
{define: Ab7 base-fret 5 frets 2 3 1 3}
{define: Dbm base-fret 1 frets 1 1 0 4}
{define: Dbmmaj7 base-fret 1 frets 4 3 3 3}
{define: Dbm7 base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 4}
{define: Gb7 base-fret 1 frets 3 4 2 4}
{define: Gbm base-fret 1 frets 2 1 2 0}
{define: B7 base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 0}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[Bb]   [Eb]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[Eb]Vive intensa[Ebmaj7]mente, [Dm7] un poquito [G7]más
[Cm]Llena tu exis[Cmmaj7]tencia, [Cm7] un poquito [F7]más
[Fm]Ama tierna[Bb7]mente, [Bb7]↓ un poquito [Eb]más
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
[E]Besa suave[Emaj7]mente, [Ebm7] un poquito [Ab7]más
[Dbm]Sueña lo impo[Dbmmaj7]sible, [Dbm7] un poquito [Gb7]más
[Gbm]Ama ciega[B7]mente, [B7]↓ un poquito [E]más [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Interludio}
[E]· · · · | [Emaj7]·     · · · | [Ebm7]·    · [Ab7]·   ·
[Dbm] · [Gbm] · | [B7] · [B7]↓ Un poquito más
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 3}
[E]Besa suave[Emaj7]mente, [Ebm7] un poquito [Ab7]más
[Dbm]Sueña lo impo[Dbmmaj7]sible, [Dbm7] un poquito [Gb7]más
[Gbm]Ama ciega[B7]mente, [B7]↓ un poquito [E]más
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Un po[E]quito más
Un po[E]quito más
Un po[E]quito más
Un po[E]quito más
[E]↓
{end_of_verse}
